# oracle: the minimize path of examples/PACKAGES/smtbq/in.smtbq.Al: pair_style smtbq on the 2x2x2 Al cell (as w189sq_al), 10 NVE steps, then fix box/relax tri 0.0 vmax 0.001 with minimize 1.0e-8 1.0e-10 (at most 300 iterations, the example allows 1000; cut down), unfix, thermo 1, 5 NVE steps. Measures the energy and the box of the minimizer path and the step counter it advances
# native: LAMMPS b332f28 built from source with -D PKG_SMTBQ=on -D PKG_MANYBODY=on -D PKG_KSPACE=on -D PKG_MOLECULE=on -D PKG_EXTRA-FIX=on (the scratch build of the SMTBQ package, the installed lmp has no SMTBQ)
# oracle-potentials: ffield.smtbq.Al
# Measured with native LAMMPS: the SMTBQ build (b332f28 with -D PKG_SMTBQ=on) agrees with the engine at every thermo row of the 39 (max rel: pe 4.6e-15, temp 6.5e-15, lx 1.9e-12, press 5.2e-10 at row 27; atoms xu, yu, zu, fx, fy, fz at most 1.6e-9). The earlier 1e-9 departure at the first box/relax step was the fix box/relax remap: the box origin moved by the tilt terms of the affine map, and the triclinic box force used the off-diagonal stress times h^-1 (both fixed in src/engine/fix/box_relax.ts to native fix_box_relax.cpp remap and min_energy)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units		metal
atom_style	charge
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
variable a equal 4.05
variable nx equal 2
variable ny equal 2
variable nz equal 2
variable rac3 equal sqrt(3.0)
variable rac1_2 equal sqrt(0.5)
variable rac3_2 equal sqrt(1.5)
variable bx equal ${a}*${nx}*${rac1_2}
variable by equal ${a}*${ny}*${rac3_2}
variable bz equal ${a}*${nz}*${rac3}
lattice		sc 1.0
region          box_vide prism 0 ${bx} 0 ${by} 0 ${bz} 0.0 0.0 0.0
create_box      1 box_vide
lattice custom ${a} a1 ${rac1_2}  0.0      0.0 &
                    a2   0.0   ${rac3_2}   0.0 &
                    a3   0.0      0.0    ${rac3} &
                        basis 0.0 0.0 0.0 &
                        basis 0.5 0.5 0.0 &
                        basis 0.5 0.166666667 0.33333 &
                        basis 0.0 0.666666667 0.33333 &
                        basis 0.0 0.333333333 0.66667 &
                        basis 0.5 0.833333333 0.66667
create_atoms 	1 region box_vide
mass		1 26.98
velocity	all create 300 277387
pair_style	smtbq
pair_coeff	* * ffield.smtbq.Al Al
neighbor	0.5 bin
neigh_modify	every 20 delay 0 check yes
timestep        0.0002
thermo_style    custom step temp press pe ke etotal lx ly lz vol
thermo_modify	format float %.15g flush yes
thermo		1
fix		3 all nve
run		10
unfix		3
fix             1 all box/relax tri 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize        1.0e-8 1.0e-10 300 3000
unfix		1
thermo		1
fix             3 all nve
run             5
